\title{llmClassificR: Text Classification with Large Language Models in R}
\description{
A user-friendly toolkit for text classification using Large Language Model APIs and local HuggingFace models. Provides batch zero-shot classification (direct, few-shot, chain-of-thought, structured JSON, multi-model ensemble, scoring, and LLM-as-judge), embedding extraction (API-based via Voyage AI, Jina AI, and local via HuggingFace transformers), retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), automatic topic discovery, and integration with Exploratory Graph Analysis (EGA) for unsupervised text classification. All LLM classification functions send texts in a single batch API call for speed.

